sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Pelanggan
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant MT as Midtrans API
    participant SK as Socket.io
    participant K as Dashboard Kasir

    Note over P,K: Fase 1: Scan QR Code & Lihat Menu

    P->>B: Scan QR Code di meja
    B->>B: Buka URL /menu/{tableId}
    B->>S: GET /api/menus?available=true
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM menus WHERE is_available=true
    DB-->>S: Daftar menu
    S-->>B: Response JSON (menus + categories)
    B-->>P: Tampilkan halaman menu

    Note over P,K: Fase 2: Tambah ke Keranjang

    P->>B: Pilih item menu & tekan "Tambah"
    B->>B: Tambah item ke CartContext (state)
    B-->>P: Update badge keranjang
    P->>B: Atur quantity & catatan di cart drawer
    B->>B: Update state keranjang

    Note over P,K: Fase 3: Buat Pesanan

    P->>B: Isi nama (opsional) & tekan "Buat Pesanan"
    B->>S: POST /api/orders {table_id, customer_name, items[], note}
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM tables WHERE id = table_id
    DB-->>S: Data meja (validasi aktif)

    loop Untuk setiap item
        S->>DB: SELECT * FROM menus WHERE id = menu_id
        DB-->>S: Data menu (validasi tersedia)
        S->>S: Hitung subtotal = harga × quantity
    end

    S->>S: Generate order_number (ORD-YYYYMMDD-XXX)
    S->>DB: INSERT INTO orders (order_number, table_id, total_amount, ...)
    DB-->>S: Order created (ID)

    loop Untuk setiap order item
        S->>DB: INSERT INTO order_items (order_id, menu_id, quantity, price, subtotal)
    end

    S->>DB: SELECT order WITH relations (table, items, menus)
    DB-->>S: Complete order data

    S->>SK: emit("new_order", completeOrder)
    SK->>K: Event "new_order"
    K-->>K: Tampilkan notifikasi pesanan baru

    S-->>B: Response 201 {order: completeOrder}
    B->>B: Kosongkan keranjang
    B-->>P: Tampilkan info pesanan

    Note over P,K: Fase 4: Pembayaran via Midtrans

    B->>S: POST /api/payment/create {order_id}
    S->>DB: SELECT order WHERE id = order_id
    DB-->>S: Order data + items
    S->>S: Bangun parameter transaksi Midtrans
    S->>MT: snap.createTransaction(parameter)
    MT-->>S: {token, redirect_url}
    S->>DB: UPDATE orders SET payment_id = token
    S-->>B: Response {snap_token, redirect_url}

    B->>B: Buka Midtrans Snap popup
    P->>B: Pilih metode pembayaran & bayar
    B->>MT: Proses pembayaran

    MT->>S: POST /api/payment/notification (webhook)
    S->>MT: coreApi.transaction.notification(body)
    MT-->>S: {transaction_status, fraud_status}

    alt transaction_status = "settlement"
        S->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = "paid"
        S->>SK: emit("order_updated", updatedOrder)
        SK->>K: Event "order_updated"
        SK->>B: Event "order_updated"
    else transaction_status = "deny/cancel/expire"
        S->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status = "cancelled"
        S->>SK: emit("order_updated", updatedOrder)
    end

    S-->>MT: Response 200 OK

    B->>B: Redirect ke /order/{orderNumber}
    B->>S: GET /api/orders/{orderNumber}
    S->>DB: SELECT order WHERE order_number = orderNumber
    DB-->>S: Order data
    S-->>B: Response order data
    B-->>P: Tampilkan halaman tracking pesanan